WEBVTT

00:01:24.836 --> 00:01:30.196
when Western societies increasingly
featured thin-bodied female models

00:01:30.196 --> 00:01:31.276
in mainstream media.

00:01:32.356 --> 00:01:36.516
The Western body ideal in the 1960s
was Marilyn Monroe.

00:01:37.116 --> 00:01:40.596
By the 1970s, magazines featured Twiggy.

00:01:41.316 --> 00:01:43.476
That’s a huge shift,

00:01:43.476 --> 00:01:46.236
and such body ideals
continued shrinking.

00:01:46.836 --> 00:01:48.916
Throughout the 1980s and 90s,

00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:52.276
the gap between the average size
of regular women

00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:54.476
and the size of models continue to grow.

00:01:55.316 --> 00:02:00.316
This gap between actual
and ideal can impact self-image.